  "title": "Korean BBQ Beef (Pul-Kogi)",
  "description": "A fruity marinade - made with minced pear or kiwi, garlic, sesame oil, and rice wine - tenderizes and flavors the beef, creating a dish that is sure to please. This version is cooked on top of the stove in a grill pan.",
